This game is great. I find it much better than Terraria, one reason being there are no zombies.
It has interesting quests and missions, which Terraria has none of;
It has loads of equipment, and vehicles were recently added;
The crafting is like Terraria instead of like Minecraft, which is good.
It has unlimited planets you can fly to,  making it unlimitedly explorable, and you won't get bored by having only one world;
The updating system is also very good. You get two versions, stable, and unstable. The stable version is entirely stable; there are no crashes or bugs.
This game is awesome.

