If you haven't bought Planetary Annihilation, but love love RTS;
If your life motto is: "There is no kill like overkill";
If you just love seeing your enemies writhing in agony, pleading for mercy;
Then THIS is the game for you! Interplanetary warfare was never so satisfying!
However, if you do already own PA, beware: It's essentially the same game, but with a few more units. But what units they are!
The giant machine you can see in the pictures above for example is a seismic titan that stomps your enemies to death. Or maybe you prefer to build the Ragnarök, a literal apokalypse machine? Or keep it classical and just fire all the tanks in your arsenal at the enemy until something explodes. Whatever you choose: It will be glorious.

I backed this game during kickstarter, and when it released it was confusing and missing a lot of features, but coming back to it now this is a really solid RTS that I can play for hours at a time. Only problem I have with it right now is that high-resolution support is completely lacking. Game will only run at 1080p even though I have a 4K monitor, and if I try to override it the UI gets really tiny. Otherwise recommend!
EDIT: Looks like they fixed it not being marked DPI Aware! Now they just need to fix it so that the max GUI size is appropriate for your monitor!
